{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mr46y3pjbt8","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"context policy no rolling history kb carries info","summary":"User standing preference for agent context construction (EWM harness and future ARC agents): do NOT roll multiple past steps into a growing chat window (Duck-style eviction of accumulated turns is explicitly rejected). Per-call context = system prompt + current state + AT MOST a compact summary of the immediate previous step; all older knowledge must flow through the KB (distilled notes retrieved by mode), not through chat history. Rationale: keeps per-step token cost flat and forces knowledge to be distilled into reusable KB form instead of transient context. Also: local Ollama model context windows must be tuned per role (ornith:9b ships with num_ctx unset = 4096 default and silently truncates; 16k/64k variants exist), and different roles should use different models (vision gameplay vs coding synthesis vs cheap grading vs judge).","category":"preference","tags":["context-policy","ewm","ollama","models"],"created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-07-03T00:24:26.695Z","vec":[-0.023018721491098404,0.01564369536936283,-0.009221342392265797,-0.02679893746972084,-0.028179995715618134,-0.002199316630139947,0.08645450323820114,0.044596873223781586,0.024546101689338684,0.03512530401349068,0.027811752632260323,0.019877374172210693,0.0019252741476520896,0.030162377282977104,0.07506869733333588,0.0378180667757988,0.05203128233551979,-0.05746196210384369,-0.09327779710292816,0.010291999205946922,0.02821357548236847,-0.034303974360227585,0.044905371963977814,-0.026894398033618927,-0.046883080154657364,0.03907965496182442,-0.02361398935317993,-0.013564318418502808,0.10252689570188522,-0.025637319311499596,0.01535920612514019,0.10093715041875839,0.018040401861071587,-0.006609875708818436,0.007537982426583767,0.006622872315347195,-0.0363713800907135,-0.022551242262125015,-0.08925114572048187,-0.00819892343133688,-0.00474422937259